repository-code: "https://github.com/csglab/leaf-1"
abstract: >-
  LEAF-1 is a 12-layer DistilBERT-style transformer pretrained with masked-language modeling
  over 57.1 billion sequenced DNA fragments from cell-free DNA, bulk ATAC-seq, and
  single-cell ATAC-seq before modality-balancing replication. The frozen encoder produces
  a 9,984-dimensional window-pooled embedding per fragment. Downstream classifiers reach
  pan-cancer cfDNA detection AUC 0.949 on the Cristiano cohort and scATAC cell-type
  classification mean AUC 0.93 with a simple linear probe.
